            <abstract>
                <gco:CharacterString>Motorways are major roads used for long distance travel.This table details the network of motorway links in England, sourced from National Highways internal mapping system.The table includes the unique identifier name of each link on the network, the associated motorway route number and National Highways regional area.</gco:CharacterString>
